## 1. Find the total sales we've made this year.
```
SELECT SUM(PI.PRODUCT_SALE_AMOUNT)
FROM RECEIPT R FULL JOIN PURCHASED_ITEMS PI
ON R.ID = PI.ID
WHERE TRUNC(R.PURCHASE_DATE) BETWEEN TO_DATE('01-JAN-2025','DD-MON-YYYY') AND SYSDATE;
```
